## Conventions

Each in-flight run logs:
- Job ID
- Submitted UTC + status
- Launch commit SHA
- Pre-reg commit SHA (if run > <COMPUTE_THRESHOLD>)
- Reviewer summary (`<N blockers / M high / K medium / J nits>`)
- Dataset manifest (snapshot path, generation_date, lookback, filter convention vN)
- Compute (instance × hours × $)
- `requirements.lock.txt` S3 path

24h staleness SLO: if a job marked InProgress hasn't had its status updated in >24h,
query SageMaker (`aws sagemaker describe-processing-job` / `describe-training-job`)
to reconcile before resuming.
